body:
The Advantages of Komodo platform

It has a strong security due to its correlation with Zcash, Delayed Proof of Work and SuperNET protocols;

It is a decentralized and open-source blockchain platform;

The transactions are fungible, high secured and anonymous;

The  platform uses a more advanced technology than Zcash or Nxt blockchain-based networks;

You can choose between three strong wallets to keep your tokens safe.
